<span id="S4.F5.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Feature similarity between the <math id="S4.F5.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="F_{A}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F_{A}</annotation></semantics></math> embeddings and the teacher target <math id="S4.F5.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u^{\prime}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>′</mo></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u^{\prime}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math></span> encoded in the R/G/B channels, one for each object in input scenes from POD.</span></figcaption>
