            <span id="alg2.l1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> Initialize empty support set </span><math id="alg2.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{S}\leftarrow\emptyset" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">𝒮</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em" mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{S}\leftarrow\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg2.l1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
