<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="Pt0.A5.F8.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 8</span>: </span><span id="Pt0.A5.F8.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Fitting the PCA curve <math id="Pt0.A5.F8.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma\simeq\frac{a}{(x+1)^{b}}+c" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>≃</mo><mrow><mfrac><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>b</mi></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma\simeq\frac{a}{(x+1)^{b}}+c</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="Pt0.A5.F8.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a=18,b=0.47,c=-0.26" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.47</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>0.26</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a=18,b=0.47,c=-0.26</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="Pt0.A5.T11" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 11: </span>PCA on <math id="Pt0.A5.T11.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{u}^{\prime}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>u</mi><mo mathsize="1.110em">^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mo>′</mo></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{u}^{\prime}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> in Personal Dataset (mAP/mAcc ± std). Last column (Avg) reports average across the 7 columns. Overall best in bold.</figcaption>
